repository-code: "https://github.com/pradeepdegalaroyal/spectroscopy-guided-dd-central-spin-nuclear-bath"
abstract: "Simulation study of whether a classical filter-function surrogate fitted to a few dynamical-decoupling coherence probes can choose the best decoupling sequence for an electron spin coupled to a quantum nuclear-spin bath, compared with model-free selection under equal shot budgets."
keywords:
